# Claude Code
.claude/

# Agent tool scratch state
.codewhale/

# graphify - there is exactly one canonical graph, at the repo root. Keep its
# two portable files; ignore everything else the tool writes (machine-local and
# regenerable), including a duplicate graph left behind by running it from a
# subfolder such as jobcard-system/.
# Note the trailing /* : ignoring the directory itself would stop git from
# descending into it, and the negations below would never be reached.
**/graphify-out/*
!/graphify-out/graph.json
!/graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
